sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Voter
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as Flask routes
  participant A as FaceAuthSession
  participant G as GestureSession
  participant D as SQLite
  V->>B: steps in front of the webcam
  B->>S: GET auth starts FaceAuthSession
  A->>A: Haar cascade finds a face
  A->>D: get_all_unvoted_voters
  A->>A: DeepFace verify ArcFace per voter photo
  A-->>B: auth_status state matched with voter name
  B->>S: POST auth_success stores voter_id in session cookie
  B->>S: GET voting starts GestureSession
  V->>G: holds up three fingers
  G->>G: MediaPipe landmarks count 3 for 3 seconds
  G-->>B: gesture_status state confirming selected party 3
  V->>G: holds thumbs up for 3 seconds
  G-->>B: gesture_status state done
  B->>S: POST confirm_vote with party
  S->>D: record_vote inserts party only and sets has_voted
  S-->>B: success then session cleared and vote_complete page
